```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant T as DB 觸發器
  participant L as 通知佇列
  participant N as pg_net
  participant F as Edge Function
  participant R as Resend

  T->>L: ENQUEUE
  L-->>T: delivery_id
  T->>N: invoke
  N->>F: http_post

  alt send ok
    F->>L: claim
    L-->>F: claimed
    F->>R: POST /emails
    R-->>F: 200 ok
  else retry ≤ 5
    F->>L: last_error + next_attempt_at
  end
```

說明：`enqueue_notification_delivery` 以 `ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING` 去重，
`claim_notification_delivery` 每次遞增 `attempt_count`；`process_due_notification_deliveries`
由 pg_cron 每五分鐘接手 pending、已到期 failed 與逾時卡住的 sending delivery。
